WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.736 --> 00:00:02.153
- I have a dream,

00:00:03.339 --> 00:00:06.422
that one day this nation will rise up

00:00:09.662 --> 00:00:12.120
and live out the true
meaning of its creed.

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:15.885
♪ Love set me free ♪

00:00:15.885 --> 00:00:18.802
♪ Love set me free ♪

00:00:20.115 --> 00:00:21.400
- I have a dream that one day

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:22.499
people will treat immigrants

00:00:22.499 --> 00:00:24.684
the same way that they
treat everyone else.

00:00:24.684 --> 00:00:26.077
- I have a dream that in the future

00:00:26.077 --> 00:00:28.211
anyone with an accent just like mine

00:00:28.211 --> 00:00:29.960
would be able to speak up

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:32.701
and their voices would be
as heard as anyone else's.

00:00:32.701 --> 00:00:35.731
- I have a dream that
little black-skinned boys

00:00:35.731 --> 00:00:37.677
and little dark-skinned girls

00:00:37.677 --> 00:00:39.270
will grow up loving their skin color.

00:00:39.270 --> 00:00:41.747
- I have a dream that I will see

00:00:41.747 --> 00:00:42.821
people that look like me

00:00:42.821 --> 00:00:45.757
more represented in tech and
in the engineering field.

00:00:45.757 --> 00:00:47.548
- I have a dream that one day

00:00:47.548 --> 00:00:49.736
more South Asians will defy convention

00:00:49.736 --> 00:00:51.400
to follow their passions

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:52.472
because you don't need to be

00:00:52.472 --> 00:00:55.628
a lawyer, doctor, or
engineer to be successful.

00:00:55.628 --> 00:00:58.550
- I have a dream that after
our first female president,

00:00:58.550 --> 00:01:00.460
we'll have our first gay president.

00:01:00.460 --> 00:01:01.409
- I have a dream that one day

00:01:01.409 --> 00:01:02.499
we'll live in a society

00:01:02.499 --> 00:01:04.237
where last names like Pena and Hussein

00:01:04.237 --> 00:01:06.579
will have the same stature
as Bush and Clinton.

00:01:06.579 --> 00:01:08.349
- I have a dream that in the future

00:01:08.349 --> 00:01:10.109
women, no matter where they're from,

00:01:10.109 --> 00:01:11.816
how much money they make,

00:01:11.816 --> 00:01:16.732
will have complete access
to reproductive health care.

00:01:16.732 --> 00:01:17.867
Simple as that.

00:01:17.867 --> 00:01:19.653
- I have a dream that no child

00:01:19.653 --> 00:01:22.866
will ever have to grow
up without a family.

00:01:22.866 --> 00:01:25.037
- I have a dream that one day

00:01:25.037 --> 00:01:27.954
systemic racism is just eliminated.

00:01:29.026 --> 00:01:30.276
One day, right?

00:01:33.106 --> 00:01:36.583
♪ Love set me free ♪

00:01:36.583 --> 00:01:39.416
(uplifting music)

00:01:54.587 --> 00:01:57.350
♪ Love set me free ♪

00:01:57.350 --> 00:01:59.899
- We will be able to speed up that day

00:01:59.899 --> 00:02:01.776
when all of God's children,

00:02:01.776 --> 00:02:05.126
black men and white
men, Jews and Gentiles,

00:02:05.126 --> 00:02:06.736
Protestants and Catholics,

00:02:06.736 --> 00:02:08.782
will be able to join hands

00:02:08.782 --> 00:02:11.579
and sing in the words of
the old Negro spiritual,

00:02:11.579 --> 00:02:14.107
"Free at last, free at last.

00:02:14.107 --> 00:02:17.126
"Thank God almighty, we are free at last."

00:02:17.126 --> 00:02:20.459
(crowd cheering wildly)

00:02:22.890 --> 00:02:24.884
- [Man] All right, all
right, let's go now.

00:02:24.884 --> 00:02:25.876
Let's go.

00:02:25.876 --> 00:02:28.404
And keep order, keep order.

00:02:28.404 --> 00:02:31.560
(crowd cheering)

00:02:31.560 --> 00:02:32.584
(whooshing)

00:02:32.584 --> 00:02:33.732
(metal creaking)

